<title>JAPAN: Honda falls on possible production cut.</title>
<headline>Honda falls on possible production cut.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd shares fell on Wednesday morning in fairly heavy trade after the firm said it was considering lowering its production plans for July, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0027 GMT, the shares were down 100 yen or 2.94 percent at 3,300, the 11th-largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
